OL,3,GNEWSABusy motorway closed following
OL,4,Apower fault
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn electrical fault has forced the
OL,7,Fclosure of a busy motorway.
OL,9,FThe M5 is shut in both directions
OL,10,Fbetween Junction 22 at Burnham-on-Sea
OL,11,Fand Junction 23 at Bridgwater to allow
OL,12,FNational Grid to deal with the issue on
OL,13,Fan overhead line.
OL,15,FThe nearby A38 has been allocated as
OL,16,Fthe main diversion route.
OL,18,FWhile the exact location of the cable
OL,19,Fhas not been confirmed, the M5 was also
OL,20,Fclosed in June in the same area due to
OL,21,Fthe risk of overhead electricity cables
OL,22,Ffalling onto the road.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
